  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Early Childhood Development(ECD) in Government School of Kageshwori Manohara Municipality, Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to enhance the early childhood development (ECD) education capacity of public schools in the Kageshwari Manohara Municipality. Nepal has set a long-term national strategy to improve access to quality education, and Kageshwari Manohara Municipality is also making efforts to raise education standards. However, due to budget constraints, the municipality faces challenges in improving educational environments and securing qualified teaching staff. To address this, the project will renovate ECD classrooms and educational facilities, provide educational materials, strengthen teacher capacity, and conduct community outreach and parental education. These efforts aim to improve the ECD education capacity of public schools in Kageshwari Manohara and enhance access to quality ECD education.</narrative>
  </description>
